  [1mChoices the spec left open (listed in the plan for you to check):[0m
  - The defaults are newest first ([38;5;153msort=startedAt[39m, [38;5;153mdir=desc[39m) and all environments. Each unknown value falls back to its
    own default.
  - Chip colors map onto the template's existing ones, which match the spec: succeeded green, failed red, rolled-back
    amber, in-progress blue.
  - When sorting by Service, each service's deploys still appear newest first.
  - "Started" shows the raw ISO timestamp, the same as "Deployed" on the Services page.
  - If "All environments" ever matches nothing, the page says "No deploys". The spec only covers the case where one
    environment is chosen.

